act = {"start": "2026-11-12 19:00", "end": "2026-11-12 20:15", "stage": "Vue in the Light, Screen 7", "act": "Atlantic Rhapsody", "type": "film", "url": "https://www.leedsfilm.com/whats-on/atlantic-rhapsody-1byr", "blurb": "A rare chance to see the first Faroese-produced feature film, Katrin Ottarsdóttir’s inventive debut takes us through 24 hours in Tórshavn, the world’s smallest capital.\nMoving nimbly between 52 interconnected vignettes, the film follows the city’s inhabitants through everyday encounters, comic mishaps and unexpected moments of magic, all with a largely non-professional cast. Funny, whimsical and brimming with life, Atlantic Rhapsody builds into an affectionate portrait of a city and its people.\nContains a graphic scene of childbirth."}
